  "solution": {
    "text": "Consider the condition of equilibrium for the mass of water contained between cross section separated by x and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math> from rotation axis.<br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ω</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math> ;<br /><br /><math><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></munderover><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></munderover><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ω</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math><br /><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0080_75a81aaf4937.png\" /><br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ω</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msubsup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow